{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Horn-Blower: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja60'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 60 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Āsīsavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>10. Saṅkhadhamajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Horn-Blower: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Dhame dhame nātidhame, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Blow, blow, don’t overblow, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>atidhantañhi pāpakaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>for overblowing is bad. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Dhantenādhigatā bhogā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>By blowing riches were earned, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>te tāto vidhamī dhaman”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>but your blowing dad blew it. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Saṅkhadhamajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Āsīsavaggo chaṭṭho. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yathā icchiṁ tathāhudakā thalā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sura sāduphalo ca alīnamano; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sampahaṭṭhamano caturo ca tayo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sataladdhaka bhogadhanena dasāti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
